"outputs/37382668-1999-4475-b50f-2887449d5c93-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This depth is substantially reduced compared to the original Hadamard test. "
"This depth is manageable on modern quantum computers, though it is still "
"quite high. We will need to use state-of-the-art error mitigation to obtain "
"useful results.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
